[00:02.71]1. We are Jehovah’s army,
[00:05.42]Under Christ, his Son.
[00:08.13]Though we’re opposed by Satan,
[00:10.84]We are marching as one.
[00:37.53]We keep serving faithfully,
[00:39.78]Preaching far and near;
[00:42.03]We remain determined
[00:44.28]With no hint of fear.
[00:46.53](Chorus)
[00:48.78]We are Jehovah’s army;
[00:51.03]With his Christ we’re one,
[00:53.28]Joyfully declaring,
[00:55.53]“God’s rule has begun.”
[01:16.22]2. We are Jehovah’s servants,
[01:20.57]Searching for his sheep,
[01:24.92]Those who are lost and scattered,
[01:29.42]Those who sigh and who weep.
[01:33.92]These we try to find and feed
[01:38.68]With repeated calls;
[01:42.88]These we keep inviting
[01:45.88]To our Kingdom Halls.
[01:48.88](Chorus)
[01:51.88]We are Jehovah’s army;
[01:54.62]With his Christ we’re one,
[01:59.62]Joyfully declaring,
[02:04.62]“God’s rule has begun.”
[02:19.48]3. We are Jehovah’s army,
[02:23.85]Under Christ’s command,
[02:28.22]Fully equipped for battle,
[02:32.75]Each one firmly will stand.
[02:37.28]Cautious though we need to be,
[02:41.95]Upright we remain.
[02:45.07]In the face of danger,
[02:48.20]Truth we will maintain.
[02:51.32](Chorus)
[02:54.44]We are Jehovah’s army;
[02:57.57]With his Christ we’re one,
[03:03.21]Joyfully declaring,
[03:12.21]“God’s rule has begun.”